==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pigge Victorious]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Pencil Launcher's Japanese name, Rocket Launcher Pencil, may be a reference to [https://youtu.be/N2ZpOuFED9M Rocket Pencils].

